Transport adapters implement the `Transport` port (packages/core/src/ports/transport.ts).

Planned adapters:
- `hyperswarm.ts` — Pear-stack transport for the desktop main process (Node)
- `webrtc.ts` — RTCDataChannel transport for browser contexts
- `mock.ts` — in-memory transport for tests

An adapter is selected by the consuming app at bootstrap (e.g. apps/desktop/main).
The domain layer must never import from this directory.
